+
+# Request
+
+Add `availability(query)` to the rental service, where `query` is `{ start, end, kind? }`. It returns the
+ids of the equipment of that kind (any kind when none is given) that is free for the whole period, sorted.
+
+# Acceptance
+
+- Same period rules as `quote`/`book` (whole days, midnight UTC, end exclusive); invalid periods and an
+  unknown kind are rejected.
+- An item with a booking overlapping the period is excluded; adjacent bookings do not exclude it.
+- Ids are sorted; tests under `node --test`.
